## The governing principle — no view from nowhere

Above every rule below stands one principle, controlling for the whole series:

> **Every object, comparison, quantifier, recurrence, residual, symmetry, and theorem is indexed by an exhibited carrier and its declared comparison family.** There is no unindexed "all cuts," "all possible re-cuts," "the world offers," "exactly two statistics," or even "exists." There is only: *within exhibition $\mathcal{E}$, under comparisons $J$, on carrier $K$.*

An unindexed totality — of all re-cuts, all assignments, all self-matchings — would quietly perform the function of a demon or a cosmic observer, and is refused wherever it appears. This is why M1 (below) is a rule of **admission**, not a claim about all being: the calculus has no authority to speak about non-exhibited being; it does not assert such being impossible. That boundary is the GTOC spine's own — *a regime-relative calculus for admitted obstruction packets; it does not manage untyped reality* — and it governs **every ontological sentence in Papers 0–10**.

## Genesis Bias — no antecedent domain

**Genesis Bias is the unpriced importation of a completed antecedent domain in order to explain an exhibited difference.** The imported domain may appear as a container, substrate, state-space, law, observer, temporal order, possibility space, or prior totality. The bias occurs whenever a construction says that difference *happens in*, *arises from*, *is carried by*, *is selected within*, or *is governed under* something whose own availability has not been constructed or declared and priced.

**It is distinct from the View from Nowhere** (the governing principle above), and the two are the series' paired root-hygiene rules: the View from Nowhere smuggles an *unindexed judge* — an observer, totality, or total quantifier with no carrier; Genesis Bias smuggles an *unconstructed host* — a container, source, arena, or antecedent with no degree and no price. The corpus already refuses each characteristic form separately (prior space, primitive time, modality, hard substrate, observer privilege, a universe of pre-given objects, unindexed totalities); Genesis Bias gives those refusals **one diagnostic name**, and the M4 anti-substrate ruling supplies most of its substance.

**Characteristic forms** (each an unpriced antecedent): *difference occurs in something*; *structure exists under appearances*; *a state is selected from a pre-existing state-space*; *laws govern a world before lawful regularity has been constructed*; *time begins at an initial state*; *matter occupies space*; *an observer receives a representation of an already-completed external reality*; *"possibilities" exist before probability or modality has been earned*.

**Genesis Bias is a methodological diagnosis, not a metaphysical theorem.** This series does not assert that no unexhibited being exists. It asserts that **no alleged prior host has standing inside the calculus unless its exhibition, degree, and price are stated.** The root is therefore *not* Difference placed inside Structure (see "The two root channels"): an admitted cut carries two irreducible costs — Primitive Difference names the non-sameness it presents, Structure names the exhibited retention of it and its pole-tokens — and neither channel precedes, contains, creates, produces, or generates the other. A **carrier** is not a prior container in which cuts occur; `carrier` names the retained local exhibition of cuts, poles, and declared comparisons. A state-space is not presumed before states; a law is not presumed before lawful transformations; an observer is not presumed outside the comparisons it declares; and time is not available to order the conditions from which time is to be constructed.

**The flag (failure-protocol form):**

> **GENESIS-BIAS FLAG.** The present construction explains [X] by presupposing [Y] as its prior host, source, arena, or governing domain. [Y] is not available at this degree. What would have to be admitted: [Z]. What is lost if it is admitted: the claimed construction of [Y] from lower-degree resources.

Genesis Bias **introduces no object, degree, authority, or layer**. It is a cross-cutting audit *over the existing No-Unpriced-Import rule*, run per section via the Genesis-Bias audit line (Mandatory audit, above). Its one open formal obligation is **PL-GTOC-GB1** (the Difference/Structure independence-or-inseparability question; see "The two root channels").

## Standing meta-rules (declared, not derived — see Paper 0 §0)

- **M1 (Exhibition — a rule of admission, not of being).** To be *admitted to this calculus* at a degree is to be exhibited by the structures available at that degree. This does **not** claim that non-exhibited being is impossible; it states that the calculus has no standing to speak about it (the governing principle above). This is the series' reading of the Structure channel of ENC-1138 (`Real₀ = PrimitiveDifference ⊔ Structure`); it is declared, not derived. The exhibition also *holds tokens apart* (see K3): apartness-in-exhibition is a Structure fact, not a comparison outcome.
- **M2 (Reflection — a ruling, not a neutral default).** Cuts are things; the primitive applies to them. Unrestricted self-application is **not** a neutral default — it is itself a declared choice (a restriction would be an added rule, but so is admitting unrestricted application). Flagged as a ruling on the footing of M1/M3/M4.
- **M3 (Closed-Witness-Free Incidence Admission, adopted in Paper 1; representation repaired 2026-07-17).** A packet is admitted only if no cut is its own immediate pole ($\neg(\alpha\prec\alpha)$) and no nonempty K11 incidence-witness term has equal endpoints. This is an *admission restriction* on packets, **not** a foundation placed under the world and **not** a theorem. It directly states the closed-witness refusal used by Paper 1; it does not rely on a numbered path, path length, completed graph, or cycle-extraction induction. Self-referential and cycle-bearing carriers are quarantined, not shown impossible. The former graph-acyclicity shorthand is superseded wherever it would import an unexhibited path representation.
- **M4 (Representation-priority ruling — the anti-substrate stance; adopted for the unification layer).** **This system does not admit a hard-substrate claim without a separately declared and priced realization packet.** “Hardness and qualia are representations” should remain an interpretive ruling in the unification layer, not a standing foundational fact governing Papers 0–10. "Reality," "hardness," and qualia are read as **representations** — typed residuals on one persistence/descent scale, not a further ontological kind (Paper 4). This is the corpus's PD-priority stance (ENC-1140: residual-Structure exhausts all Structure) taken as a **declared ruling on the footing of M1–M3, not a theorem**. It cannot be proven from inside without circularity — the same circularity that makes the Root Certifier irreducible; ENC-1140 stays open, ENC-1122 stays a conjecture. The break with the inherited "fundamental reality" picture is precisely this: Plato's error was *asserting* a fundamental layer as discovered fact; M4 keeps the stance and refuses the assertion — a priced ruling, never a smuggled truth.

## The single admitted import — the Root Certifier (`[ROOT]`)

Every construction in the series bottoms out on one irreducible act: **certifying that two exhibited differences are the same** — a zero-difference judgment (ENC-0757 "sameness is certified zero-difference"); operationally, a replay-check. Call it the **Root Certifier**. It cannot be derived: to derive it you would already have to judge two derivations the same, which *is* the act. It is therefore the series' **sole admitted import**, tagged `[ROOT]` and quarantined like the continuum — but on the *admission* side of the gate, not the refusal side: it is named and paid, once. This is the corpus's C4-irreducible replay-trust-root (ENC-0399 item 5; PL-024-5, OPEN), promoted from a scattered assumption to a single declared primitive. Authority is never absolute: it is the terminal **RootReplaySeal** — sealed relative to the declared Root Certifier, never to a reality outside it (extends A9; ENC-1063 `StructureDerived ⊬ IsAuth`).

The distinction should be:

```text
Root Certifier:
    verifies replay identity or trusted execution evidence

Authority:
    requires the separate GTFDA/GTLA descent and terminal packet
```

A root seal may support evidence. It must not become the only hidden authority source. Naming one irreducible and quarantining it is stronger than pretending none exists.

## The observer, dissolved

There is no observer from nowhere. An "observer" is a **declared-comparison scope** (convention K6) carried by a witness-family that holds **no privilege** — Paper 2's No-Privileged-Witness theorem is the formal statement, and it is the anti-"Observer from Nowhere" result of the whole series. Every observer, gauge, norm, window, and terminalizer must be packet-indexed, must expose its declared comparisons, and must carry its verification root. None stands outside the packet.

Do not identify these objects with one another.

The math spine already models this correctly by separating:

```text
ObserverStatus
GaugeStatus
NormStatus
```

The charter should follow the spine. (Unification detail: `unification_1_observer_and_root_certifier.md`.)

## Standing flagged conventions (declared in place; indexed here)

The series' total standing cost is **M1–M4, plus the single `[ROOT]` import (the Root Certifier), plus the conventions below**. Each is declared and flagged at its home section; anything else doing load-bearing work unflagged is a smuggle and a defect.

| id | Convention | Declared at |
|---|---|---|
| K1 | Outcome-determinacy: every exhibited confrontation of a candidate cut yields exactly one of {holds, fails} | Paper 0 §2.1 |
| K2 | Mark convention: reflexivity as the ground of mark re-use | Paper 0 §3.2/§3.4 |
| K3 | Exhibition-apartness: the exhibition may hold two cut-tokens apart although every comparison between them fails; apartness is not a comparison outcome | Paper 0 §3.3 |
| K4 | Meta-numerals: expository numerals are case-listing names over explicitly exhibited configurations, never counts | Paper 0 §1.2 |
| K5 | $\oplus$-closure: the exhibition of reference assignments is closed under pointwise $\oplus$ | Paper 0 §7.1 |
| K6 | Declared-comparison families: which comparisons count is a declared, packet-local (proto-observer) selection; token-apartness (K3) is never among the comparisons. Paper 1's recurrence instance additionally records $\Sigma=(J,\operatorname{supp},\kappa,\tau)$, separates coherent three-valued evidence $\mathsf{R}/\mathsf{T}/\mathsf{?}$ from total routing, refuses support/calibration contradictions, requires a designated type-witnessed comparison, and preserves inherited receipts under support-disjoint conservative extension | Paper 1 §3.1 (general convention used Paper 2 §2.1, Paper 3 §4.1) |
| K7 | Homogeneity of weights under ratio-rescaling | Paper 2 §3.3 |
| K8 | Orientation convention for signed cochains | Paper 3 §2.2 |
| K9 | Exchange-saturation: full indistinguishability as a carrier declaration exhibiting the full self-matching family of $W$ | Paper 3 §4.2 |
| K10 | Declared equivariance of weightings: an admissible weighting assigns matched values under every declared-outcome-preserving self-matching (replaces the metalinguistic "definable from declared comparisons"; derivation route = PL-GTOC-13) | Paper 2 §4.2 |
| K11 | Typed incidence-witness algebra: **(a) edge-grounding** — $\operatorname{edge}_{\alpha\beta}:\alpha\Rightarrow_{\prec}\beta$ requires displayed $\alpha\prec\beta$; **(b) typed binary join** — endpoint-matching $u:\alpha\Rightarrow_{\prec}\beta$ and $v:\beta\Rightarrow_{\prec}\gamma$ are closed under the constructor yielding $v\star u:\alpha\Rightarrow_{\prec}\gamma$; **(c) provenance completeness** — $\alpha\lhd\beta$ holds exactly when the packet exhibits a nonempty term from those constructors. There is no identity constructor. This is a declared witness algebra, not a completed nesting or path collection. The former finite-descent, concatenation, path-certificate, and `Relation.TransGen` renderings are withdrawn as unpriced representations; machine artifacts must preserve the explicit edge/join syntax | Paper 1 §2.1 |

**Two of these conventions are load-bearing costs, not minor bookkeeping — they generate large parts of the later structure and must be read as major:**

- **K1 (bivalence) builds the binary universe.** That every confrontation yields exactly one of {holds, fails}, exhaustively, is what produces the two-valued object $\mathbb{D}$, XOR/parity, the ring-free closure identity, the sign object, and ultimately the two-character exchange classifier. $\mathbb{D}$ is difference reflected *through an exhaustive bivalence ruling*, not merely "reflected once." Without K1 there may be unresolved, graded, partial, or incompatible outcomes; all of the later rigidity is **K1-relative**.
- **K3 (exhibition-apartness) is a Structure channel, not Difference.** The distinction between two recurrence tokens is not supplied by any comparison outcome (every comparison between them may fail) — it is supplied by the exhibition that holds them apart. That is exhibitionary Structure, the second primitive channel, and it is why the root is `PrimitiveDifference ⊔ Structure` rather than difference-monism.

## Relation to the corpus

- **GTOC** = the General Theory of Obstruction Calculus, the umbrella program over the ODP packet standard and the Finite Obstruction Cosmology vocabulary (`omega_engine/research/published/qm/_archive/gtoc_qm_recursion/00_census.md` §3, `01_governing_digest.md`). It is not a tower layer.
- This series is the **basement** under Paper 000 (*Primitive Axiomatics of Finite Obstruction Calculus*): it prices each of Paper 000's standing assumptions A0–A9 (ENC-0196) as derived, scoped, or imported. Paper 3 §1 carries the full reconstruction table.
- The series is an **attempt on the PD-priority program**, which the corpus holds as a declared-open conjecture (ENC-1140, Lean-firewalled against promotion). Nothing here claims to close it. ENC-1122 (PrimitiveDifference Universality) likewise remains a conjecture and is not cited as a theorem anywhere in the series.
- Claim vocabulary: the ODP claim types `[DERIVED] [IMPORTED] [CONDITIONAL] [STANDARD] [CONJECTURE] [INTERPRETIVE] [OPEN] [Q-HELD] [REFUSED] [SCOPE FENCE]` are used in ledgers and inline; each paper additionally carries a hygiene-standard Claim Ledger using the six normative tags (`[PROVEN] [PROVEN, CONDITIONAL] [STANDARD] [CONJECTURE] [INTERPRETIVE] [OPEN]`).
- **Two series-only ledger flags, mapped to the ODP vocabulary (so the Import-Ledger flag column is closed like the DDA alphabet):** `DECLARED` marks a standing meta-rule or convention (M1–M4, K1–K11) — it is the *hypothesis* of a `[PROVEN, CONDITIONAL]` claim, never itself a derivation; `OBSTRUCTION` marks a failure-protocol block — it resolves to `[OPEN]` (underivable, no witness yet) or `[REFUSED]` (never admitted in-series).
- **Continuum labelling — `Q-gated (G7)`, not `[Q-HELD]`.** The ODP terminal `[Q-HELD]` asserts a *complete, dated admission debt* (finite shadow, refinement relation, declared topology, convergence-certificate route, live descent trigger — the five-criterion gate, ENC-1165). This series fills **none** of those for the continuum; it refuses/defers it. So continuum rows are tagged **`Q-gated (G7)`**: the object sits at the five-criterion gate on the *refusal side* — admission debt unfilled in-series, hence not admitted, never derived. The `[Q-HELD]` terminal is deliberately not claimed anywhere in the series.

## The unification layer (2026-07-13) — one system, one only

Operator ruling: align the entire GTOC/GTLA/Q stack into **one system running on the priced root admission of Difference and Structure and the Obstruction Calculus** (the earlier "one system running on Primitive Difference" wording is withdrawn — it quietly drops the Structure channel, a Genesis-Bias slide), with no imported "Observer from Nowhere" and no imported antecedent domain, and with the system's own math and code arising within it. The six compression moves are realized as the unification documents registered below. Thesis: there is **one engine** (retained admitted cut → repair `δ⁰`/quotient `Q¹`/closure `δ¹` → residual signature `Φ₁,Γ₂` → trichotomy → terminal-or-refusal, canonically defined in Paper 0 with `δ¹δ⁰=0` a *theorem* not an axiom); everything the corpus calls GTOC, GTLA, Q, or "the tower" is a **view, a degree, or a carrier-gate** of that one engine — not a separate theory.

## The foundational position (what this series can honestly say)

The position emerging from the canonical degree papers is more exact than "everything is Difference," "It from Bit," or *Laws of Form*:

> There is no prior universe of objects located in space and changing in time. Where cuts are jointly exhibited and retained, `carrier` names that retained local exhibition — it is not a prior object *in* which cuts occur. A cut presents poles and apartness rather than relating already-completed things. **Structure** is the exhibited-retention channel of the cut (not a host that "permits" cuts — "permits" is capacity/modal language, withdrawn). A **residual** is a difference that admitted transformations cannot eliminate. Identity, order, number, proportion, geometry, and physical law are not background furniture; each is a later construction or declaration over a retained local exhibition.

It does **not** claim: that being is information; that reality computes; that observation creates reality; that a cosmic form re-enters itself; that the universe was selected for observers; that any divine or demonic standpoint sees the total structure; or that the calculus exhausts whatever is real. The world, on this account, is not a thing inside a void, not a total set, not a trajectory through pre-existing time, not a distribution over possibilities. Its strongest in-series wording is indexed and conditional: wherever a retained admitted cut is exhibited, Structure is the retention channel of its pole-tokens and Difference is the non-sameness it presents; obstruction marks retained patterns that cannot be eliminated under the declared comparison family. Nothing in the sentence promotes a vanished flicker into being, witness, weight, or authority.

## Files and canonical publication homes

The series now has two ownership surfaces:

1. `omega_engine/general_theory_of_obstruction_calculus/papers/999_GTOC/` owns the charter, math spine, theorem ledger, and unification/control documents.
2. `omega_engine/research/published/050_gtoc_ground_state/` through `062_gtoc_everettian_qm/` own the claim-bearing papers and their sibling claim ledgers.

Publication is a relocation, not duplication. No canonical paper remains under `999_GTOC/`. Every paper keeps its inline claim ledger as the wording source of record and has one sibling ledger that mirrors those rows, records the source-qualified count, and enforces `AuthorityEffect::None`. Paper 3a is an independent claim source at `053a` so its five rows are neither merged away nor counted twice.

